# REC while the default proof transport is running must be ignored.
100 btn 13
150 keys 1
200 keys 0

# Stop transport, wait for the audio-side stopped acknowledgement, then enter STEP REC.
250 btn 12
350 btn 13

# In STEP REC OCT+ changes pitch octave, not the 16-step page.
400 btn 1

# Simultaneous white-key downs audition both notes; D024 writes only the lowest
# pitch internally and latches the write gesture until all note keys release.
450 keys 5
500 keys 0

# A new fully released gesture auditions/writes the next step.
550 keys 8
600 keys 0

# PLAY while STEP REC is active exits STEP REC before resuming transport.
650 btn 12
700 keys 1
750 keys 0

# HOME restores normal PERFORMANCE audition at the STEP REC octave.
800 btn 8
850 keys 1
900 keys 0

# Stop again, enter and leave STEP REC with REC, then prove REC exit remains SEQ.
950 btn 12
1050 btn 13
1100 btn 13
1150 keys 1
1200 keys 0

# HOME returns to performance once more.
1250 btn 8
1300 keys 1
1350 keys 0
1450 end
